<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Project Software views up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Project Software views up.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Robertson Stephens &amp; Co analyst Eric Upin said he raised his earnings estimates today on Project Software &amp; Development.</p>
<p>- He raised his fiscal 1997 estimate to $1.56 a share from $1.53, and his 1998 estimate to $2.03 from $1.97.</p>
</text>
